# Internal go-to-market material. prospects.csv and outreach-log.csv hold
# named contacts, job titles, work emails and outreach history for ~100 real
# people, and this repository is public. Keep local, never commit.
# campaign-links.csv is the exception: it is campaign taxonomy with no
# personal data, and tests/growth/acquisition-taxonomy.test.ts reads it.
docs/launch/*
!docs/launch/campaign-links.csv

# Tooling coupled to the gitignored outreach data above. These read
# docs/launch/outreach-log.csv and prospects.csv, which are deliberately not
# in the repository, so committing them would fail npm test on a fresh clone.
scripts/verify-outreach-ledger.mjs
tests/growth/outreach-ledger.test.mjs
